## Safety reminder

- **Never copied:** passwords, browser cookies, session tokens, DPAPI-locked
  browser credential stores, or private SSH/GPG keys.
- **Re-login required on Linux:** browser sync/accounts, password manager,
  email/chat/dev services, and any app that uses local secrets.
- **Review before sharing:** this report may list usernames, device names,
  paths, app names, and file counts. Remove sensitive details before posting.

